and even the probabilistic nature of quantum mechanics.

49:52.260 --> 49:55.760
It is a master class in seeing exactly how much physics can be derived

49:55.760 --> 49:58.260
purely from the requirement of logical closure.

49:58.600 --> 50:02.300
And why should you care about this deep dive into abstract mathematics?

50:02.780 --> 50:05.700
Because if even a fraction of this framework holds up,

50:05.900 --> 50:09.600
it means the universe might not be a collection of fundamentally disconnected objects

50:09.600 --> 50:11.560
thrown onto a pre-existing stage,

50:11.860 --> 50:14.280
playing by arbitrary rules handed down from on high.

50:14.380 --> 50:15.320
It changes everything.

50:15.420 --> 50:18.860
It might be a single, continuous, recursive, error-correcting fabric.

50:19.380 --> 50:22.280
The rules of physics, the mass of an electron, the speed of light,

50:22.340 --> 50:24.440
the force of gravity, might not be rules at all.

50:24.820 --> 50:28.240
They might just be the specific, necessary geometric shapes

50:28.240 --> 50:30.680
required to keep that fabric from tearing itself apart.

50:31.040 --> 50:35.640
It is a deeply interconnected, remarkably holistic view of reality.

50:35.640 --> 50:38.360
And I want to leave you with a final thought to mull over,

50:38.860 --> 50:42.740
a thought that builds on what we discussed about CLIO and simulated agency.

50:43.000 --> 50:43.320
