50:43.940 --> 50:47.500
If the fundamental universe operates via the CLIO mechanism,

50:48.120 --> 50:49.940
constantly minimizing obstructions,

50:50.400 --> 50:51.560
running gradient descent,

50:51.900 --> 50:55.140
repairing contradictions across overlapping patches of reality

50:55.140 --> 50:56.900
to maintain coherence,

50:57.280 --> 51:00.180
and human cognition, our own brains,

51:00.620 --> 51:02.900
use the exact same mathematical gradient descent

51:02.900 --> 51:05.600
to resolve contradictions in our thoughts and perceptions.

51:05.840 --> 51:07.940
And the boundary between the observer and the observed

51:07.940 --> 51:09.620
