51:16.600 --> 51:18.060
Are we not just living in the cosmos?

51:18.880 --> 51:23.380
Are we literally the cosmos repairing its own localized admissibility obstructions?

51:23.440 --> 51:24.640
It's a profound thought.

51:24.900 --> 51:26.040
When we figure something out,

51:26.120 --> 51:28.160
